---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { base } from "../consts";
import img0 from "../assets/team-silverstone.png";
import img1 from "../assets/uploads/2026/09/Irish-Cement-Logo.png";
import img2 from "../assets/uploads/2026/09/Serosep-edited.png";
import img3 from "../assets/uploads/2026/09/Onsemi_logo_2021.svg_.webp";
---

<Layout title="Our Partners">
    <div class="wp-block-cover alignfull" style="min-height:166px">
        <Image
            src={img0}
            alt=""
            class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-80 size-full"
            style="object-position:50% 60%"
            width={1920}
            format="webp"
            quality={80}
            loading="lazy"
        />
        <span
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="wp-block-cover__background has-base-background-color has-background-dim-80 has-background-dim"
        ></span>
        <div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container">
            <h1
                class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left alignwide has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color"
                style="font-size:5rem"
            >
                Our Partners
            </h1>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="wp-block-group alignfull has-base-background-color has-background is-layout-constrained"
        style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);--content-size:800px;--block-gap:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)"
    >
        <h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left alignwide has-accent-2-color has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size">
            Backed by industry leaders
        </h2>
        <p class="has-text-align-left alignwide has-contrast-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size">
            Formula Student UL wouldn't be on the track without the support of
            our partners. Their expertise, resources and belief in our team let
            us design, build and race a car of our own.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div
        class="wp-block-group alignfull has-accent-2-background-color has-background is-layout-flex"
        style="min-height:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);flex-wrap:nowrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;--block-gap:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)"
    >
        <figure class="wp-block-image size-full">
            <Image
                src={img1}
                alt=""
                class="wp-image-90"
                width={763}
                format="webp"
                quality={80}
            />
        </figure>
        <figure class="wp-block-image size-full">
            <Image
                src={img2}
                alt=""
                class="wp-image-96"
                width={1000}
                format="webp"
                quality={80}
            />
        </figure>
        <figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-style-default">
            <Image
                src={img3}
                alt=""
                class="wp-image-97"
                width={1000}
                format="webp"
                quality={80}
            />
        </figure>
    </div>
    <div
        class="wp-block-group alignfull is-layout-constrained"
        style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);--content-size:800px;--block-gap:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)"
    >
        <h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-accent-2-color has-text-color has-x-large-font-size">
            Why partner with us
        </h2>
        <hr class="wp-block-separator has-text-color has-accent-2-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-accent-2-background-color has-background is-style-wide" />
        <p class="has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size">
            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Quisque at
            neque mattis, malesuada velit vel, facilisis tortor. Phasellus vel
            iaculis dui. In libero ipsum, convallis vitae tellus nec, posuere
            mollis turpis. Vivamus convallis tortor eros, vel suscipit nibh
            sollicitudin non. Maecenas id pretium magna, a varius ligula.
            Pellentesque congue neque ut erat fermentum posuere. Donec vel
            egestas enim, sed pellentesque tellus. Fusce ante ex, porttitor at
            mattis ac, fermentum eget arcu. Pellentesque habitant morbi
            tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas.
            Nullam molestie sollicitudin eros sit amet fringilla. Fusce vitae
            eros ut leo tincidunt mollis. Nullam scelerisque leo at rhoncus
            dapibus. Vestibulum tristique finibus semper. Etiam faucibus gravida
            leo vel hendrerit. Proin non lacus bibendum purus condimentum
            maximus in non ligula. Duis euismod, sapien hendrerit pharetra
            sollicitudin, ipsum magna pharetra nisl, consectetur congue nisi
            neque at lorem.
        </p>
        <p class="has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size">
            Nulla interdum mauris metus, vitae pretium velit tempus vel.
            Suspendisse bibendum auctor ligula, ut vestibulum arcu tristique
            nec. Ut placerat erat convallis vehicula sodales. Quisque lobortis
            neque vel pretium facilisis. Donec id nulla tellus. Pellentesque
            massa felis, pulvinar bibendum auctor nec, sagittis eget quam.
            Quisque nunc lorem, venenatis at libero quis, auctor scelerisque mi.
            Duis interdum convallis ante, id convallis nisl hendrerit ac.
            Vestibulum placerat in magna et pharetra. Duis a euismod massa.
            Curabitur consequat malesuada nisi, nec pharetra ligula porttitor
            ut.
        </p>
        <p class="has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size">
            Nunc faucibus nisl in ultricies ultrices. Class aptent taciti
            sociosqu ad litora torquent per conubia nostra, per inceptos
            himenaeos. Vivamus in eros tempus, aliquam magna at, euismod mi.
            Donec consequat nisi ut iaculis venenatis. Pellentesque habitant
            morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis
            egestas. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut
            viverra sem lacus, at aliquet est sollicitudin et. Aenean sed felis
            consequat justo convallis ultrices. Donec sit amet tristique ante.
            Proin a pharetra tellus, eget interdum justo. Aliquam erat volutpat.
            Duis et sollicitudin leo. In hac habitasse platea dictumst.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div
        class="wp-block-group alignfull has-accent-3-background-color has-background is-layout-constrained"
        style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);--content-size:1200px"
    >
        <h2 class="wp-block-heading has-contrast-color has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size">
            Ways to partner
        </h2>
        <div
            class="wp-block-group is-layout-grid"
            style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(16rem,100%),1fr));--block-gap:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"
        >
            <div
                class="wp-block-group has-contrast-color has-accent-5-background-color has-text-color has-background is-layout-constrained"
                style="border-radius:12px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);--block-gap:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)"
            >
                <h3 class="wp-block-heading has-contrast-color has-text-color">
                    Financial Support
                </h3>
                <p class="has-contrast-color has-text-color">
                    Help cover the build, testing and travel costs of getting a
                    car to competition.
                </p>
                <p style="font-weight:700">
                    <a href={`${base}/meettheteam/`}>Get in touch →</a>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div
                class="wp-block-group has-contrast-color has-accent-5-background-color has-text-color has-background is-layout-constrained"
                style="border-radius:12px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);--block-gap:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)"
            >
                <h3 class="wp-block-heading has-contrast-color has-text-color">
                    Parts &amp; Materials
                </h3>
                <p class="has-contrast-color has-text-color">
                    Supply components, materials or manufacturing time that go
                    straight onto the car.
                </p>
                <p style="font-weight:700">
                    <a href={`${base}/meettheteam/`}>Get in touch →</a>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div
                class="wp-block-group has-contrast-color has-accent-5-background-color has-text-color has-background is-layout-constrained"
                style="border-radius:12px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);--block-gap:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)"
            >
                <h3 class="wp-block-heading has-contrast-color has-text-color">
                    Technical support
                </h3>
                <p class="has-contrast-color has-text-color">
                    Share engineering knowledge, tooling and mentoring with our
                    student team.
                </p>
                <p style="font-weight:700">
                    <a href={`${base}/meettheteam/`}>Get in touch →</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="wp-block-cover alignfull is-dark"
        style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);min-height:360px"
    >
        <Image
            src={img0}
            alt=""
            class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-80"
            style="object-position:50% 60%"
            width={1920}
            format="webp"
            quality={80}
            loading="lazy"
        />
        <span
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="wp-block-cover__background has-base-background-color has-background-dim-80 has-background-dim"
        ></span>
        <div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container">
            <h2 class="wp-block-heading alignwide has-contrast-color has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size">
                Ready to join the grid?
            </h2>
            <p class="has-contrast-color has-text-color has-large-font-size">
                Talk to us about how your company can back the next generation
                of engineers.
            </p>
            <div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex" style="flex-wrap:wrap">
                <div class="wp-block-button">
                    <a
                        class="wp-block-button__link has-base-color has-accent-2-background-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button"
                        href={`${base}/meettheteam/`}
                        style="font-style:normal;font-weight:700"
                    >
                        Meet the team
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline">
                    <a
                        class="wp-block-button__link has-contrast-color has-text-color wp-element-button"
                        href={`${base}/ourcar/`}
                        style="font-style:normal;font-weight:700"
                    >
                        See our car
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p></p>
</Layout>
